{{!-- ignition: noblock --}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
{{> site/head}}
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="sheet">
{{> site/header}}
<main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="contribute sheet-inner">
  <section class="plate" data-plate="01 · authors">
    <p class="kicker">for authors</p>
    <h1>{{title}}</h1>
    <p class="lead">One pull request = one dump. CI rejects junk before merge; the owner reads a first PR by hand. Everything after that is trust.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="pr-flow plate" data-plate="02 · flow">
    <h2>Bring a dump</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Fork the repository and add <code>content/dumps/&lt;slug&gt;/manifest.json</code> and <code>raw.md</code>.</li>
      <li>Open one pull request per dump.</li>
      <li>CI validates the manifest schema and rejects junk before merge.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="manifest-schema plate" data-plate="03 · schema">
    <h2>Manifest schema</h2>
    <p>Required fields: slug, title, type, domain, date, stakes, trust_level, content_flags, summary.</p>
    <pre class="block-machine">{
  "slug":    "YYYY-MM-DD-short-name",
  "title":   "string",
  "type":    "note | case | pack",
  "domain":  "engineering | finance | art | law | science | education | other",
  "date":    "YYYY-MM-DD",
  "stakes":  "low | medium | high",
  "trust_level": "raw | self-tested | community-tested | adapted | library",
  "content_flags": [],
  "summary": "1–3 sentences"
}</pre>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Secrets cleaned: tokens, keys, passwords, personal data never enter a dump.</li>
      <li>Examples are synthetic; real financial or personal data is never published.</li>
      <li>Sources include correspondence → REDACTIONS.md attached with the removed list.</li>
      <li>Stakes and flags are honest: underestimating risk withdraws the dump.</li>
      <li>generated_by is honest: agent / human / hybrid. No disguise.</li>
      <li>Heavy files go to a Release by tag convention, not into the repository.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="licences plate" data-plate="04 · licences">
    <h2>Licences</h2>
    <p>Built on Ignition. MIT for code, CC-BY-4.0 for content.</p>
    <p class="micro"><a href="https://github.com/krivich/kodavr/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">House rules and the PR template — CONTRIBUTING.md</a> · <a href="https://github.com/krivich/kodavr/issues">Questions and risk reports — GitHub Issues</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
{{> site/footer}}
</div>
</body>
</html>
